Origin: ROCKNIX, projects/ROCKNIX/packages/emulators/libretro/crocods-lr/patches/001-keyboard.patch at 6cf94dba (GPL-2.0).
ROCKNIX's (from christianhaitian): the US keyboard layout instead of the French one

From 997a1f4851c53eca18c17ef753e284b3420ff871 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: christianhaitian <mckman@comcast.net>
Date: Tue, 26 Jan 2021 14:10:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Change keyboard mapping from French to US

---
 libretro.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libretro.c b/libretro.c
index 7ca34cc..37345ed 100644
--- a/libretro.c
+++ b/libretro.c
@@ -172,7 +172,7 @@ void retro_init(void)
 
     // Get map layout
 
-    gb.keyboardLayout = 1; // French
+    gb.keyboardLayout = 0; // English
 
     for (i = 0; i < RETROK_LAST; i++)
         KeySymToCPCKey[i] = CPC_NIL;
